  "local_changes": [
    "Require EFI_RNG_PROTOCOL or a fresh 256-byte host seed; remove the TSC/xorshift fallback.",
    "Build the GNU-EFI dependency and loader from pinned source under Bazel.",
    "Select rd=md0 rootfstype=hfs when an EFI RAM disk was actually loaded.",
    "Reserve x86 RAM disk pages as EFI reserved memory so XNU does not recycle their contents.",
    "Compile/link the EFI loader directly in its Bazel action; retain upstream CMake/Nix recipes as inactive source files.",
    "Document the supported Bazel build/boot entry points in README.md.",
    "Validate actual GOP stride/aperture bounds, release query-mode buffers, and publish actual RGBX/BGRX metadata through an additive /chosen/native-framebuffer property without changing boot_args layouts.",
    "Keep direct GCC temporary files inside the Bazel EFI action's existing work directory."
  ]
